repository-code: "https://github.com/Surge77/expense-analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A bank-statement analysis pipeline that measures its own keyword
  categorisation rules against a TF-IDF and logistic-regression classifier on
  real hand-labelled transactions, reporting random, grouped and temporal
  splits so the effect of near-duplicate notes is visible.
